<section class="approach" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-heading"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / Engineering approach</div><h2 id="approach-heading">Built for the real world.<br><span class="serif">Not just the demo.</span></h2></div><p>Useful systems are not only about the framework. They're about the decisions behind them.</p></div><div class="approach-grid"><article class="approach-card"><div class="approach-num">01 — THINK</div><h3>Understand the problem.</h3><p>Clarify what people need, map the workflow, and work backward from a measurable, practical outcome.</p></article><article class="approach-card"><div class="approach-num">02 — ENGINEER</div><h3>Build with intention.</h3><p>Design cohesive interfaces, predictable APIs, maintainable data models, and sensible security boundaries.</p></article><article class="approach-card"><div class="approach-num">03 — ITERATE</div><h3>Make it dependable.</h3><p>Test assumptions, investigate failures, document tradeoffs, and improve based on evidence.</p></article></div><div class="approach-foot"><span>ENGINEERING MINDSET / CLARITY → QUALITY → RELIABILITY</span><strong>Less spectacle, more substance ↗</strong></div></div></section>